# SEERA Dataset

## Source
Mustafa, E.I. and Osman, R. (2020) "SEERA: a software cost estimation dataset for constrained environments," *Proceedings of the 16th ACM International Conference on Predictive Models and Data Analytics in Software Engineering*.

## License
Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY)

## Citation
Mustafa, E.I. and Osman, R., 2020. SEERA: a software cost estimation dataset for constrained environments. In *Proceedings of the 16th ACM International Conference on Predictive Models and Data Analytics in Software Engineering* (pp. 61-70). ACM.

## File Description
- **Filename:** SEERA_cost_estimation_dataset.xlsx
- **Format:** Excel (.xlsx)
- **Rows:** 120 project instances
- **Columns:** 76 features
- **Target Variable:** Actual Effort (person-months)

